From ce4f0424ba92e7e50630358b10b2f87e45893edb Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: local <local@example.invalid>
Date: Sat, 3 Oct 2026 23:40:01 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 14/34] WP08: Passport upload hardening

Cross-WP fix: tests/test_admin_guest_data.py (WP04) compared the served passport photo with the raw PNG it stored; WP08 re-encodes stored photos, so the test now compares with passport_photos.read_photo().

Conflict resolution: main.py lifespan with WP06 (applied earlier in this order). Kept WP06's role check and db.startup_lock() block; WP08's process-wide bound (Image.MAX_IMAGE_PIXELS = passport_photos.MAX_IMAGE_PIXELS) replaces the old 12 MP line, before the lock. WP08 changes app.css, so the app.css?v= key in base.html, auth_base.html and public_legal_base.html goes from WP28's 20261004w to 20261004y.
